[1 2 3]
int32


Change data type from float to integer by using int as parameter value

import numpy as np
arr = np.array([1.1, 2.1, 3.1])
newarr = arr.astype(int)
print(newarr)
print(newarr.dtype)

OUTPUT:
[1 2 3]
int64


Change data type from integer to boolean

import numpy as np
arr = np.array([1, 0, 3])
newarr = arr.astype(bool)
print(newarr)
print(newarr.dtype)

OUTPUT:
[ True False  True]
bool


